    "blurb": "Manage HubSpot contacts, companies and deals",
    "overview": "Easily connect Camunda to HubSpot to manage contacts, companies, deals, and forms. Automate CRM tasks such as creating and updating records, searching data, and enrolling contacts in workflowsall without writing code.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Automate HubSpot CRM workflows",
    "splashDescription": "The HubSpot outbound Connector allows you to automate customer relationship management (CRM) operations directly from your Camunda processes. It implements seamless interaction with HubSpot's API to manage contacts, companies, and deals—enabling you to create, update, delete, and search entities without writing custom integration code. Common use cases include enrolling contacts in workflows, submitting forms, retrieving deal information, and batch-reading contact data. This connector is ideal for automating sales, marketing, and customer service processes with minimal setup.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/521819/overview/img18059133829804835255.png?8754b1a390576ed6c4341f8f5129a830",
